message: "If you use Pantheon, please cite this software."
title: "Pantheon"
abstract: >-
  Pantheon v1.5.2 is an OpenCode plugin and installer for coordinating
  14 specialized agents. The repository includes reusable skills,
  slash-command definitions, MCP server implementations, documentation, and
  tests. O Pantheon v1.5.2 é um plugin e instalador para OpenCode que
  coordena 14 agentes especializados, com skills reutilizáveis, comandos
  slash, servidores MCP, documentação e testes.
version: 1.5.2
